Experiment 11: Develop a program to a water level detection system using Ultrasonic sensor.



AIM: The main objective of this project is to design and implement a simple, water level monitoring system using an ultrasonic sensor (HC-SR04) interfaced with an Arduino microcontroller. The system continuously measures the distance between the water surface and the sensor, compares it with a predefined threshold, and provides real-time feedback about the water level.


